  0008          145: STATUS:ACTUALCOUNT      EQU     SCBLK:RPLEN     ACTUAL # STATUS BYTES READ
  000E          146: STATUS:SCLEN    EQU     SCBLK:DATA      STATUS SYSCALL BLOCK MINIMUM LENGTH
