  0008          162: GETERROR:ACTUALCOUNT    EQU     SCBLK:RPLEN     SHOULD BE RETURNED AS 2
  000E          163: GETERROR:SCLEN  EQU     SCBLK:DATA      GETERROR SYSCALL BLOCK LENGTH
                164: *
  0002          165: DISPERROR:SCLEN EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    DISPERROR SYSCALL BLOCK LENGTH
