                575: **********************************************************************
  0010          576: FILESYSTEMVERSION       EQU     $10     VERSION 1.0 OF FILESYSTEM FORMAT
                577: ********************************************************************
                578: *
                579: *       FUNNY VALUES TO MAKE DATA STORAGE ALLOCATION USES MORE CLEAR
                580: *
  0000          581: IGNORED EQU     0       SO I CAN MARK PLACES AS IGNORED
  0000          582: CHANGED EQU     0       SO I CAN MARK PLACES AS CHANGED
                583: *
                584: *       LOCATIONS 0-7 ARE TREATED AS PART OF TASK'S CONTEXT
                585: *       AND SAVED DURING A CONTEXT SWITCH
                586: *
                587: *       DEFINED TEMPORARIES
                588: *       USED TO PUSH (X) ONTO STACK IN INTERRUPTABLE WAY
                589: *       FOR USE BY TASK-LEVEL SUBROUTINES
                590: *
  0000          591:         ORG     $0
0000 0002       592: TEMPX   RMB     2       ANY SUBROUTINE MAY STEP ON THIS!!!
  0000          593: TEMP    EQU     TEMPX   FOR CONVENIENCE
  0000          594: TEMPA   EQU     TEMPX   TEMP STORAGE FOR A REGISTER
  0001          595: TEMPB   EQU     TEMPX+1 TEMP STORAGE FOR B REGISTER
                596: 
                597: *
                598: *       PROTECTION BITS FOR DIR:PROTECTION
                599: *
  0040          600: PROT::WRITE     EQU     $40     PROTECT AGAINST WRITES
  0001          601: PROT::BACKUP    EQU     $1      PROTECT AGAINST BACKING UP




