01F3 A600       233:         LDAA    0,X
01F5 9734       234:         STAA    STATEVARBASE+1
                235:         ;LDX    STATEVARBASE
01F7 DE33       236:         LDX     STATEVARBASE
01F9 39         237:         RTS
                238: *
