ASM/6800 1.4A0: 0C32 METAM14C.ASM       
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 93; Form 3      *** SDOS 1.1 DEFINITIONS ***
M.ASM
                412: ******** THIS CHUNK OF STUFF GETS ERROR DISPLAY ON FIRST LINE TO WORK RIGHT ***
  0000          413:         IF      *+1<<INPUTBUFFER+INPUTBUFFERSIZE
 *S*            414:         ORG     INPUTBUFFER+INPUTBUFFERSIZE-1
                415:         FIN
0C33 0D         416:         FCB     ASCII:CR        THIS MAKES ERROR ON FIRST SOURCE LINE PRINT
                417: **************************************************************
  0C34          418: INPUTBUFFEREND  EQU     *
  0C34          419: OUTPUTBUFFER    EQU     INPUTBUFFEREND
  0C80          420: OUTPUTBUFFEREND EQU     EST:METAMSIZE
  004C          421: OUTPUTBUFFERSIZE        EQU     OUTPUTBUFFEREND-OUTPUTBUFFER
  0000          422:         IF      OUTPUTBUFFERSIZE<<50
 *S*            423:         ? OUTPUT BUFFER LENGTH TOO SMALL FOR EFFICIENT OPERATION ?
                424:         FIN
  0C80          425: METAMEND        EQU     OUTPUTBUFFEREND
  0000          426:         IF METAMEND>>EST:METAMSIZE
 *S*            427:         ?METAMACHINE SIZE ESTIMATE EXCEEDED?
                428:         FIN




