0C80 0003       431: DEBLANKTOKEN    RMB     3       JMP TO DEBLANK TOKEN RECOGNIZER
0C83 0003       432: ERRORTOKEN      RMB     3       JMP TO ERROR RECOVERY TOKEN BUSTER
0C86 0003       433: KEYWORDTOKEN    RMB     3       JMP TO KEYWORD TOKEN BUSTER
0C89 0002       434: DICT    RMB     2       INITIALLY POINTS TO END +1 OF META PROGRAM
0C8B 0002       435: KEYWORDCHAIN    RMB     2       POINTER TO CHAIN OF KEYWORDS
0C8D 0002       436: METACODE        RMB     2       POINTER TO INITIAL META CODE (BANNER MESSAGE
                437: *
                438: *       29 TOKENS
                439: *       576 SUBROUTINES
                440: *
0C8F 003A       441: TOKENADD        RMB     29*2    POINTERS TO TOKEN BUSTING ROUTINES
0CC9 0480       442: SUBRADD RMB     (64+256+256)*2  POINTERS TO PARAMETERIZED SUBROUTINES
1149 0000       443: STATEVARS       RMB     0       UP TO 256 STATE VARIABLES
                444:         END     BEGIN   WHAT DID YOU EXPECT?




